="00:35.660">Can you save it too?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.660" end="00:37.160">You're not the one that I need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.760" end="00:38.260">To stay high on my feet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.150" end="00:40.610">Don't need you to succeed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.610" end="00:42.870">Can you feel that hate that runs to you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.870" end="00:44.370">Can you feel it too?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.120" end="00:45.620">If you wanna lie to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.490" end="00:46.990">You must change the file</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.930" end="00:48.430">Play your games</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.520" end="00:49.020">Be with your jerks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.970" end="00:49.690">It will be just fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.690" end="00:51.190">If you'll ever see yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.800" end="00:52.300">Just the way you are!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.910" end="00:53.410">Don't come back and cry for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.320" end="00:54.820">'Cause you've gone too far</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.620" end="00:56.120">If you wanna lie to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.100" end="00:56.600">You must change the file</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.590" end="00:58.090">Play your games</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.260" end="00:58.760">Be with your jerks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.960" end="00:59.460">It will be just fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.440" end="01:00.940">If you'll ever see yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.410" end="01:01.970">Just the way you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.970" end="01:03.470">Don't come back and cry for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.210" end="01:05.220" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">('Cause you've gone too far)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.220" end="01:06.720">If you wanna be with me</p><p ttm: